Henri, an elderly man with a slim stooped build, gray wavy short hair, and a full white beard, wearing a long grey wool overcoat, an orange knitted wool scarf, brown corduroy trousers, and black leather shoes, carries Léa in his arms across the grey pavement away from the bridge. Léa, a stocky toddler girl with brown straight chin-length hair and bangs, dressed in a red wool knit cardigan, grey corduroy trousers, and brown leather ankle boots, rests her arms against Henri's shoulder and looks back at him with worried brows, wide brown eyes, and an open mouth. Henri looks down at her with a gentle, neutral gaze and calm lips. Below them on the pavement, l'ombre stretches out as a long, flat near-black shadow shape with thin limbs. In the midground, the stepped-gable stone castle of the Landvogteischloss with its round stair turret rises tall against forested hills covered in brown and orange autumn foliage under the fading dusk sky, while the brown-tiled roof of the covered wooden bridge spans the green river to the left. A tall black iron lamppost stands by the pavement edge, and distant unnamed figures in dark brown and black coats walk along the far street. Ultra-wide shot.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Henri carries Léa off the bridge and along the castle street at dusk while her long dark shadow stretches across the pavement below. The Landvogteischloss and covered bridge stand in the background.","characters":[{"name":"Henri","clothing":"standard","position":"walking along the castle street","depth":"midground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows level, eyes steady, mouth closed"},{"name":"Léa","clothing":"standard","position":"in Henri's arms","depth":"midground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows drawn together, eyes wide, mouth slightly parted"}],"era":"present day","weather":"drizzle","objects":[],"interactions":[{"character":"Henri","object":"Léa","where":"carries Léa in his arms","action":"carrying Léa","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"},{"character":"Léa","object":"Henri","where":"rests arms against Henri's shoulder","action":"holding","hands":true,"storyRelevant":false,"priority":"normal"}],"wornItems":[]}

Élodie, a young adult woman of average build with light brown wavy mid-back hair parted in the centre, brown eyes, and a silver necklace, wearing a yellow chunky knit turtleneck sweater, a long black skirt falling to the calf, black tights, and black leather ankle boots, kneels on the grey bath mat beside the white enamel bathtub in the bathroom. Her fingers grip the chrome tap at the head end of the tub, turning the handle as water roars into the basin, creating swirls of white bubbles. Her gaze is focused down on the chrome tap in her hands, her brows level and mouth relaxed in a calm expression. White-tiled walls surround the tub, a folded pale blue towel rests on a wall rail nearby, and a small frosted side window reflects the dimming dusk light of autumn outside. Medium shot.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Élodie kneels by the bathtub and turns the chrome tap as water flows into the tub. The white-tiled bathroom is quiet at dusk.","characters":[{"name":"Élodie","clothing":"standard","position":"kneeling beside the bathtub","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows relaxed, eyes focused down, mouth closed"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","objects":[],"interactions":[{"character":"Élodie","object":"the chrome tap","where":"turns the chrome tap","action":"turning the tap","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"}],"wornItems":[]}

Seen from above in a high-angle shot, Jules, a slim kindergarten-age boy with dark brown straight short combed hair and blue eyes, wearing a green hooded fleece jacket over a grey crew-neck T-shirt, blue denim jeans, and black canvas trainers, sits at the edge of the white enamel bathtub, holding a handful of soapy foam in his cupped hands and gazing down at the bubbles with a calm mouth and steady brows. Beside him, Léa, a stocky toddler girl with brown chin-length hair and bangs, wearing a red wool knit cardigan, grey corduroy trousers, and brown leather ankle boots, holds up both hands, counting on her small fingers as she looks across at Jules with widened brown eyes and parted lips. Along the back wall, Élodie, a young adult woman with light brown wavy hair wearing a yellow chunky knit turtleneck sweater and a long black skirt, kneels at the tub's side, watching Léa with calm eyes and a quiet mouth. Across the white enamel rim of the tub lies l'ombre, stretched out as a solid flat near-black silhouette with long thin arms and a smooth featureless head. Dusk settles through the tiled bathroom.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Jules sits by the bath looking at bubbles in his hands while Léa counts on her fingers looking at him, and Élodie watches Léa. A long dark shadow lies across the rim of the bathtub.","characters":[{"name":"Jules","clothing":"standard","position":"at the edge of the bathtub","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows relaxed, eyes lowered, mouth quiet"},{"name":"Léa","clothing":"standard","position":"beside Jules by the bathtub","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows pulled tight, eyes wide, mouth parted"},{"name":"Élodie","clothing":"standard","position":"kneeling beside the tub","depth":"midground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows level, eyes soft, mouth relaxed"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","objects":[],"interactions":[{"character":"Jules","object":"bubbles","where":"holds bubbles in cupped hands","action":"holding bubbles","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"},{"character":"Léa","object":"Jules","where":"counts on fingers looking at Jules","action":"counting on fingers","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"},{"character":"Élodie","object":"Léa","where":"watches Léa by the tub","action":"watching","storyRelevant":false,"priority":"normal"}],"wornItems":[]}

In a close-up shot framed from the waist up, Léa, a stocky toddler girl with brown straight chin-length hair, bangs at her eyebrows, and brown eyes, wearing a red wool knit cardigan over a white long-sleeve T-shirt, leans close to the ear of Élodie, whispering with raised brows, widened eyes, and an open mouth. Élodie, a young adult woman with light brown wavy hair loose to her shoulders, wearing a yellow chunky knit turtleneck sweater and a thin silver necklace, turns her head to look down at Léa with a calm face, relaxed brows, and a closed mouth. Behind them along the white-tiled wall, the chrome tap rises beside the white enamel tub rim, where the edge of l'ombre appears as a flat, solid near-black shadow shape along the upper tile surface, kept completely out of Léa's line of sight as she keeps her gaze fixed directly on Élodie's ear.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Léa leans close to Élodie's ear and whispers while looking at her, keeping her eyes away from the shadow on the tiles. Élodie looks back at Léa with a calm expression.","characters":[{"name":"Léa","clothing":"standard","position":"leaning near Élodie by the tub rim","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows raised, eyes wide, mouth open in a whisper"},{"name":"Élodie","clothing":"standard","position":"beside Léa at the bathtub","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows level, eyes calm, mouth closed"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","objects":[],"interactions":[{"character":"Léa","object":"Élodie","where":"whispers into Élodie's ear","action":"whispering","storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"},{"character":"Élodie","object":"Léa","where":"listens to Léa","action":"watching","storyRelevant":false,"priority":"normal"}],"wornItems":[]}

Marc, a young adult man of average build with dark brown wavy short hair brushed back with a side part, defined angular jawline, and brown eyes, wearing a brown waxed cotton field jacket over a white henley shirt, dark blue denim jeans, and brown leather lace-up boots, stands in the downstairs living room holding ART002.1, a closed teal cloth-covered picture book, firmly in both hands. He looks down at the teal picture book with a focused gaze, his brows level and his mouth slightly parted as he counts down aloud. Behind him in the warm room, a grey sofa with a knitted throw sits against the cream wall, a wooden coffee table rests on a red-and-cream wool rug, and a side window reveals the amber and brown leaves of autumn trees outside in the dusk light. Medium shot.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Marc stands in the living room holding the closed picture book in his hands and begins counting down aloud. The living room is warm and quiet at dusk.","characters":[{"name":"Marc","clothing":"standard","position":"in the center of the living room","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows level, eyes looking down, mouth slightly open"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","objects":[],"interactions":[{"character":"Marc","object":"ART002.1","where":"holds the picture book in both hands","action":"holding","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"}],"wornItems":[]}

In a close-up shot focused on the child's single bed, the long, flat, solid near-black silhouette of l'ombre stretches across the white pillow and over the blue-printed duvet. Tucked beneath the duvet, ART001, Pompon the plush cream-fabric rabbit, is covered by the dark shape so that only its one long floppy cream ear extends out onto the white fabric of the pillow. Beside the bed, the wooden bedside table holds a small round metal tin against the pale green wall of the bedroom, where the quiet dusk light filters through the window in autumn.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"The long dark shadow stretches across the pillow and duvet, hiding the plush rabbit so only one long ear shows. The child's bed sits beside the wooden nightstand at dusk.","characters":[],"era":"present day","weather":"none","objects":[],"interactions":[],"wornItems":[]}

Léa, a stocky toddler girl with brown chin-length hair and bangs, dressed in purple cotton long-sleeve pyjamas with front buttons, matching purple pyjama trousers, and bare feet, stands in the upstairs corridor before her partly open white bedroom door, forcefully stamping her foot against the pale wooden floorboards. She glares into the doorway at l'ombre with tight brows, wide brown eyes, and an open mouth. Jules, a slim kindergarten-age boy with dark brown combed hair and blue eyes, wearing a blue short-sleeve pyjama top, blue pyjama shorts, and grey wool socks, stands beside her on the pale blue runner rug, watching Léa with calm brows and a relaxed mouth. Inside the doorway, l'ombre, a flat near-black silhouette with long thin limbs, mirrors Léa's pose with one leg stamped out. Medium shot along the cream-painted hallway under the soft glow of the wall lamp at dusk.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Léa stamps her foot at her open bedroom door in her pyjamas while Jules watches her, and the dark shadow inside mirrors her stamp. The corridor is lit by a wall lamp at dusk.","characters":[{"name":"Léa","clothing":"nightwear","position":"in front of the bedroom door","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows furrowed, eyes wide, mouth open in determination"},{"name":"Jules","clothing":"nightwear","position":"beside Léa in the corridor","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows relaxed, eyes attentive, mouth closed"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","objects":[],"interactions":[{"character":"Léa","object":"CHR001","where":"stamps foot toward the shadow","action":"stamping foot","storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"},{"character":"Jules","object":"Léa","where":"watches Léa at the doorway","action":"watching","storyRelevant":false,"priority":"normal"}],"wornItems":[]}

Léa, a stocky toddler girl with brown straight chin-length hair and bangs, wearing purple cotton pyjamas and bare feet, stands firmly in the doorway of her bedroom, holding one hand raised at shoulder height as she stares straight ahead at l'ombre. Her face is calm and attentive, with level brows, steady brown eyes, and a quiet mouth. Across the pale wooden floor inside the room, l'ombre, a flat near-black silhouette with long thin limbs, stands motionless with its thin shadow hand raised in the air, mirroring her gesture perfectly. The cream-painted corridor walls and the soft runner rug lead into the bedroom under the gentle dusk glow. Medium shot.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Léa stands still in the doorway with one hand raised, looking directly at the dark shadow which stands motionless with its hand raised too. The corridor and bedroom are quiet at dusk.","characters":[{"name":"Léa","clothing":"nightwear","position":"in the doorway","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows level, eyes steady, mouth closed"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","objects":[],"interactions":[{"character":"Léa","object":"CHR001","where":"raises hand toward the shadow","action":"raising hand","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"}],"wornItems":[]}

In an over-the-shoulder shot from the bedroom doorway, the cropped back of Marc's head, shoulder, and upper arm in his brown waxed cotton jacket fill the near corner as his hands hold open ART002.2, the deep teal picture book, looking down at its cream pages with calm brows and a gentle mouth. In the midground bed against the pale green wall, Léa, a stocky toddler girl with brown chin-length hair and bangs, sits tucked under the blue-printed duvet in her purple pyjamas, hugging ART001, Pompon the cream plush rabbit, against her chest with both arms. She looks toward l'ombre beside the bed with arched brows, crinkling eyes, and a wide happy smile. Beside the single wooden bed, l'ombre rests along the wall as a flat near-black silhouette with a smooth rounded head, waving a thin hand back toward her in the warm dusk light.

---METADATA---
