On the grey pavement outside the Landvogteischloss, the whole family stands together facing the camera under the clear dusk light of autumn. At the left, Henri, an elderly stooped man with a full white beard and gray hair, wears his long grey overcoat and orange scarf. Next to him, Élodie, a young adult woman with long wavy light brown hair, wears her yellow turtleneck sweater and black skirt. In the centre, Léa, a stocky toddler girl with brown chin-length hair and bangs in her red cardigan and grey trousers, stands happily between her parents. Jules, a slim kindergarten boy in his green fleece jacket and blue jeans, stands beside her, while Marc, a young adult man with dark wavy hair in his brown field jacket and jeans, stands at the right. All five look directly forward with warm, cheerful expressions and open smiles. Behind them, the stone castle and its round turret rise beside the wooden covered bridge against the autumn hills. Wide shot, with open ground in the lower portion of the frame.

---METADATA---
