Inside the covered timber Holzbrücke footbridge, the entire family gathers together along the dark timber walkway, all looking directly out with warm and happy smiles. Henri, an elderly man in his grey wool overcoat and orange scarf, sits on a low timber ledge on the left, smiling gently. Élodie, in her yellow turtleneck sweater and black skirt, stands beside him with a hand resting on Léa's shoulder. In the centre, Léa, a stocky toddler in her red cardigan and grey corduroy trousers, stands upright with a bright beam on her face, while Jules, in his green fleece jacket and blue jeans, stands next to her grinning. Marc, in his brown waxed jacket and jeans, stands at the right with a relaxed smile. Overhead, the dark timber truss frame spans the roof, and fallen autumn leaves rest along the timber floorboards in the calm dusk light. Wide shot, with clear space in the lower foreground.

